<title>USA: Gardner Denver votes two-for-one split.</title>
<headline>Gardner Denver votes two-for-one split.</headline>
<dateline>QUINCY, Ill. 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gardner Denver Machinery Inc said on Friday its board approved a two-for-one stock split in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>One additional share will be issued January 15, 1997 for every share of common held by stockholders of record at December 27.</p>
<p>Upon completion of the split, there will be about 9.9 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>Gardner Denver makes air compressor and blower products as well as pumps.</p>
<p>		 ((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
